[00:23.03] Body that rests before me
[00:24.98] With every dying breath
[00:27.25] Spellbound and gagged
[00:29.33] I commence your flesh to dirt
[00:32.81] 
[00:40.37] Body that lay before me
[00:42.27] In everlasting death
[00:44.65] Entombed in an abscess
[00:46.76] To rot and lie stinking in the Earth
[00:50.73] 
[01:10.76] Empty altar awaits its victim, stained glass windows black
[01:15.45] Candles burn the midnight oil, incense fills the night
[01:20.16] Observing trance awaking state, lying still unknowing
[01:24.52] Reciting the passages of time, prepare for the impaling
[01:30.68] 
[02:16.19] Death's an art, flesh and earth never part, a power of the mind
[02:20.73] Death shines on the air of silence, a ritual of endless time
[02:25.45] Purged of your dead body, sacrificed of your life
[02:30.14] Unearthly ritual sealed in fire, enter the kingdom of desire
